        在 <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6' }}>8GB 显存</span>的笔记本上，完全离线装下<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>整卷合同</span>，逐句回查原文<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>页码</span>
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 26, lineHeight: 1.75 }}>基于 Spark-X2.5 双模型（1.7B 常驻快答 + 4B 按需深审）与三档自适应路由；每句回答经 8-gram 溯源校验，标注可核查页码。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 158, background: '#1E293B', borderRadius: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 32, paddingRight: 28, gap: 24, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 84, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6', fontFamily: 'Inter, JetBrains Mono, Consolas, monospace', width: 240 }}>8 GB</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F1F5F9' }}>显存即可跑</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>1.7B + 4B 双模型同驻仅 5.5GB，消费级笔记本无需升级硬件</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 158, background: '#1E293B', borderRadius: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 32, paddingRight: 28, gap: 24, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 84, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#06B6D4', fontFamily: 'Inter, JetBrains Mono, Consolas, monospace', width: 240 }}>134</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F1F5F9' }}>tok/s 端侧推理速度</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>1.7B Q4_K_M 量化 + GPU 全层卸载，比原始方案快 35–60 倍</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 158, background: '#1E293B', borderRadius: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 32, paddingRight: 28, gap: 24, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 84, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F59E0B', fontFamily: 'Inter, JetBrains Mono, Consolas, monospace', width: 240 }}>0</Text>
